+## Completed (Request 17)
+- Added vatSummary(invoices) to src/reports.js
+  - Processes invoices with status 'issued', 'partially_paid', or 'paid'
+  - Groups by VAT rate, summing base and VAT per rate
+  - Returns [{ rate, base, vat }] sorted by rate descending (21, 9, 0)
+  - base = sum of (lineTotal - lineDiscount) for each line
+  - vat = sum of rounded lineVAT for each line
+- Added 17 comprehensive tests covering:
+  - Empty invoice list
+  - Status filtering (excludes draft, includes issued/partially_paid/paid)
+  - Grouping and accumulation across invoices
+  - Sorting by rate descending
+  - Base calculation with discounts
+  - VAT calculation per line
+  - Multiple VAT rates (21, 9, 0)
+  - Voucher handling (doesn't affect VAT)
+  - Large amounts and zero VAT rates
+- All 234 tests pass (217 existing + 17 new)
+
 ## Next Steps
 - Ready for additional invoice features (persistence, invoice lifecycle, etc.)
